# Deadbird - level 1: the Extraction Plant (written by tools/levels/build_e1.py).
#
# Arrival Bay (the freight lift lowers her in) -> Security Checkpoint -> the Pump Hall, the hub
# around the great extraction tank. West: stairs down to the Sump (cyan key); the cyan door opens
# the Cell Block, whose lift climbs to the Overseer's Office (amber key) and a ledge to drop back
# into the hall. East: the amber door opens the Cooling Hall; stairs climb to its gantry (crimson
# key). North: the crimson door, a corridor and stairs down to the Generator. Three secret doors.
#
# Built on a 2 m grid; rooms 2 m apart, doorways through the 2 m walls (alcove, recess, door,
# recess, alcove). Metres; x east, z north; heights up from the hall floor.

room bay Arrival Bay
room checkpoint Security Checkpoint
room hall Pump Hall
room sump The Sump
room cells Cell Block
room office Overseer's Office
room cooling Cooling Hall
room corridor Generator Corridor
room generator Generator

# ================================================================== ARRIVAL BAY (start)
sector bay room bay floor 0 ceil 8
    pts -8,-30  4,-30  4,-26  8,-26  8,-20  4,-20  4,-19.375  2,-19.375  -2,-19.375  -4,-19.375  -4,-20  -8,-20  -8,-24  -8,-26
    ftex FLOOR_DOCK
    frule FLOOR_HAZARD 99,1 0,-10
    ctex CEILING_PANEL
    crule CEILING_LIGHT 2,2 0,0
    walls BASE_PLAIN BASE_PIPES BASE_PLAIN BASE_VENT / DOCK_PLATE / DOCK_PLATE / top TOP_BEAM
    lows PLATE_SIDE
    ups TOP_BEAM / DOCK_PLATE / DOCK_PLATE
    wall 5,9 DARK_METAL
    wall 0 cell 4,1 DOCK_NUMBER
    wall 3 cell 1,1 MID_POSTER_DANGER
    wall 11 cell 1,1 MID_AUTHORIZED
    wall 11 BASE_PLAIN / DOCK_PLATE / DOCK_PLATE / top TOP_BEAM
    wall 13 BASE_PLAIN / DOCK_PLATE / DOCK_PLATE / top TOP_BEAM

